@startuml
title Shift Handover and Alert Triage Flow

actor "Shift Lead" as Lead
participant "Streamlit Dashboard" as Dash
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "FastAPI Inference" as API
participant "ML Artifacts" as ML

Lead -> Dash : Open Executive Overview
Dash -> DB : Read latest predictions, alerts, quality issues
Dash -> Dash : Build action queue
Dash --> Lead : Show priority actions

Lead -> Dash : Select machine
Dash -> DB : Read sensor and prediction history
Dash --> Lead : Show trend, health score, RUL, recommendation

Lead -> API : Trigger prediction via endpoint or script
API -> ML : Load model bundle
API -> DB : Store prediction, alert, diagnostic hint
API --> Lead : Return risk and recommendation

Lead -> Dash : Export report
Dash -> DB : Read operational summary
Dash --> Lead : Markdown shift-handover report
@enduml
